# Build output (any -DbuildDir=target-x variant)
target*/
# HTTP cache, snapshots and the run copy of the jar: re-creatable, never committed
work/
# Design notes and research, kept on the maintainer's machine only
docs/
# Research and check scripts (Python), kept local like docs/
tools/
# IDE and local tool settings
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.claude/
# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Node
node_modules/
# NOT ignored, both committed:
# - dataset/   the extracted releases: released data never needs Maven again
# - site/data/ the site data that `assemble` builds from dataset/
